# Contact form delivery.
#
# Without these the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client with
# the message pre-filled. That works, but it loses anyone who has no mail
# client configured — so set these before launch.
#
# Easiest option is Web3Forms (web3forms.com): enter hello@backstageconsultancy.co.uk,
# it emails you an access key, no account needed. Formspree and Formspark
# take the same JSON POST if you would rather use those.
#
# For the live site these go in the repository's
# Settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions -> Variables,
# and are read by .github/workflows/pages.yml at build time. They are baked
# into the built JavaScript and are public — which is fine for a form key,
# whose only power is to send you an email. Never put a real secret here.

VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
VITE_FORM_KEY=
